        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables and values\n    principal = 300_000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.045\n    years = 30\n\n    # Calculate total payments using the fixed-rate mortgage formula\n    monthly_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_payments = years * 12\n    monthly_payment = principal * monthly_rate / (1 - (1 + monthly_rate) ** -number_of_payments)\n    total_cost = monthly_payment * number_of_payments\n\n    # Return the total cost rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_cost)\n```",
